    {
      "turn": 2,
      "doctor_question": "How long have you been noticing these messages?",
      "targeted_symptom": "psychotic_symptoms_duration",
      "patient_response": "Well, let me think on that. I reckon the voices and those special messages... they've been happening on and off for about nine months now. Started right around the time I had to get the alternator fixed on my old Ford. You know, they just don't make parts for those trucks like they used to. I took it down to Earl's shop. Earl's a good boy, his daddy and I used to go fishing out at Miller's Pond before the county drained it. Caught a bass out there once that was near on five pounds, fought me for twenty minutes. Best eating fish we had all year. But yeah, nine months of it, coming and going. Earl charged me an arm and a leg for that alternator, though. I told my wife we ought to just sell the truck, but she won't hear of it. She says she needs it for hauling her garden supplies.",
